WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.666 --> 00:00:05.544
(Viserys): The Targaryens, blood of the
dragon, and the last of old Valyria,

00:00:05.545 --> 00:00:07.504
were loved by their subjects

00:00:07.505 --> 00:00:09.339
and admired far and wide

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:13.510
as the greatest dynasty
in the history of the western world.

00:00:13.511 --> 00:00:17.973
But the peace and prosperity
of nearly three centuries of Targaryen rule

00:00:17.974 --> 00:00:22.060
were shattered by the Usurper,
Robert Baratheon,

00:00:22.061 --> 00:00:24.563
and his band of traitors.

00:00:24.564 --> 00:00:29.401
House Baratheon owed
its very existence to the Targaryens.

00:00:29.402 --> 00:00:31.361
Was it not Aegon the Dragon himself

00:00:31.362 --> 00:00:35.866
who elevated the bastard Orys Baratheon
in the War of Conquest?

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:37.659
And what of the Starks?

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:38.952
The Lannisters?

00:00:38.953 --> 00:00:41.246
The Arryns of the Vale?

00:00:41.247 --> 00:00:44.500
All had been spared
and allowed to keep their lands

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:47.794
when Aegon could
easily have wiped them out.

00:00:47.795 --> 00:00:50.881
Centuries later,
the Usurper and his lackeys

00:00:50.882 --> 00:00:55.219
repaid Aegon's benevolence
with treachery.

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:57.221
There are some who dare to claim

00:00:57.222 --> 00:01:00.891
Robert and his allies had reason to rebel.

00:01:00.892 --> 00:01:05.521
They say the crown prince
stole the Usurper's lady love.

00:01:05.522 --> 00:01:07.773
They say my father, King Aerys,

00:01:07.774 --> 00:01:12.319
murdered Rickard Stark and his son
without just cause.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:15.155
Whether these charges are true or not,
it doesn't matter.

00:01:15.156 --> 00:01:18.325
The dragon answers to no one.

00:01:18.326 --> 00:01:22.913
Aerys' good name has been besmirched
in the years since the rebellion.

00:01:22.914 --> 00:01:26.500
He has been called
a dangerous madman, a monster,

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:30.671
a tyrant that brought
his tragic end upon himself.

00:01:30.672 --> 00:01:32.339
Lies!

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:36.343
My father was a victim
of weaklings in his council,

00:01:36.344 --> 00:01:39.221
lack-wits who failed him
in his hour of need

00:01:39.222 --> 00:01:42.933
and let the rebellion spin out of control.

00:01:42.934 --> 00:01:45.269
But it was not enough.

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:49.022
The royal army was crushed
at the Battle of the Trident.

00:01:49.023 --> 00:01:52.568
It was there the valiant Rhaegar
met Robert in single combat,

00:01:52.569 --> 00:01:55.070
but the gods betrayed him...

00:01:55.071 --> 00:01:58.907
and he perished by the Usurper's hand.

00:01:58.908 --> 00:02:03.908
As the Field of Fire had marked
the end of the Andals centuries before...

00:02:04.455 --> 00:02:09.001
the Battle of the Trident seemed
to herald the end of the dragon kings.

00:02:09.002 --> 00:02:12.462
When word reached the capital
of my brother Rhaegar's death,

00:02:12.463 --> 00:02:15.382
my father Aerys moved to protect me,

00:02:15.383 --> 00:02:18.677
as I was the surviving heir to the throne.

00:02:18.678 --> 00:02:21.346
He sent me to the
island fortress of Dragonstone,

00:02:21.347 --> 00:02:25.642
along with my mother, Queen Rhaella,
who was great with child.

00:02:25.643 --> 00:02:29.479
But as my father, my king...
Aerys Targaryen...

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:33.317
prepared to defend his throne
to the bitter end...

00:02:33.318 --> 00:02:35.819
little did he know
of the horrors and betrayals

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:40.820
that awaited him and our family.

